A definition inside a container is collected at that container's content column

```
> - a
>   [r]: /u

see [t][r]
.
<blockquote>
  <ul>
    <li>a</li>
  </ul>
</blockquote>
<p>see <a href="/u">t</a></p>
```

```
- a
  > [r]: /u

see [t][r]
.
<ul>
  <li>a
    <blockquote>

    </blockquote>
  </li>
</ul>
<p>see <a href="/u">t</a></p>
```

```
[x][r] here.

    > [r]: /u
.
<p>[x][r] here.</p>
<p>&gt; [r]: /u</p>
